# Whitelist: track code and the map, never the videos or build output.
*
!.gitignore
!systemFileMap.json
!*.py
!ui/
!ui/**
!release/
!release/**
!rust/
!rust/**
# Rust: bundled libmpv binaries + downloads are fetched/rebuilt (see rust/docs/BUILD_LIBMPV.md)
rust/vendor/dl/
rust/vendor/libmpv/*.dll
rust/vendor/libmpv/*.lib
rust/vendor/libmpv/*.exp
rust/vendor/libmpv/*.dll.a
rust/vendor/libmpv/exports.txt
rust/vendor/libmpv/lib_gen.log
rust/**/target/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
